TITLE Pure water equilibrated with CO2 at log PCO2 = -3.4

SOLUTION 1 Pure water
    temp      25
    pH        7.0
    pe        4.0
    units     mol/kgw
    water     1.0

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    CO2(g)    -3.4    10.0

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file     co2_equilibrium.out
    -pe       true
    -pH       true

END
